 - Contributors may only modify tasks assigned to themselves, and may not reassign tasks. Managers may modify any task.
 - Only managers may delete tasks.
 - Archived projects reject all writes with 409 (reads still work).
+- Freezing a project (`POST /projects/{pid}/freeze`) is manager-only: other roles get 403, archived projects 409. It sets every member's role to `viewer`, managers included. Nobody can change a frozen project's tasks afterwards, and a second freeze is 403 because no managers remain.
